<div class="district-intro">
<h2>
      Your Guide to Special Education in Greece CSD
     </h2>
<p>
      Welcome! We're here to help you navigate the special education process in Greece Central School District and Monroe County. Understanding your child's rights and the New York State CSE process is crucial, and we provide the tools you need.
     </p>
